0 PM", "Council reconvenes at 10:02 PM", "with  M. Brown in the Chair", "all Members present", "except  S. Turner", "H.L. Usher"]}], "__class__": "Vote"}, "result": {"string": "Motion Passed", "__class__": "MotionResult"}, "post_motion_texts": [], "__class__": "Motion"}], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VI": {"title": "CONFIRMATION\n  AND SIGNING OF THE MINUTES", "number": "VI", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VII": {"title": "COMMUNICATIONS\n  AND PETITIONS", "number": "VII", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "VIII": {"title": "MOTIONS OF\n  WHICH NOTICE IS GIVEN", "number": "VIII", "content": [], "items": {}, "datetime": null, "attachments": [], "report": null, "__class__": "MeetingItem"}, "IX": {"title": "REPORTS", "number": "IX", "content": [{"string": "18th Report of the Committee\n  of the Whole\nCouncillor J. Morgan presents.", "__class__": "Paragraph"}, {"pre_motion_texts": [], "moved_by": {"string": "Moved by Councillor J. Morgan", "__class__": "Mover"}, "seconded_by": {"string": "Seconded by Councillor M. Cassidy", "__class__": "Mover"}, "motion_texts": [{"string": "Approve that, as a procedural matter\n  pursuant to Section 239(6) of the Municipal Act, 2001, the following\n  recommendation be forwarded to the Municipal Council for deliberation and a\n  vote in public session:\n\u00a0\nThat, on the recommendation of the City\n  Manager and the Managing Director, Corporate Services and Chief Human\n  Resources Officer, the attached Memorandum of Settlement, concerning the 2015\n  \u2013 2018 Collective Agreement for the London Civic Employees Local Union No.\n  101 (Canadian Union of Public Employees) (\u201cCUPE Local 101\u201d) representing the\n  inside workers BE RATIFIED; it being noted that the Committee of the Whole\n  heard a verbal o